{"4185740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blue Artifact +", "steam_appid": 4185740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/396affc65ac338e2689009790af346d1.apng?t=1784547639\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/396affc65ac338e2689009790af346d1.poster.avif?t=1784547639\" class=\"bb_img\" width=68 height=78 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Outline&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Blue Artifact+” is a side-scrolling action game where Fran, a girl awakened deep within a research facility's underground, attempts to escape using magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility's interior serves as the stage, a complex, mutated dungeon. Scattered throughout the facility are the Doctor's records and information about Fran. Collecting these gradually reveals the facility's background and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with the magic tome left by the Doctor, Fran strives to escape from the depths of the labyrinthine facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Steam edition builds upon the free game version, implementing new stages, enemies, items, costumes, and other additional elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Magic&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/d6aabf87408e5a15744b382bb528fedd.poster.avif?t=1784547639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/d6aabf87408e5a15744b382bb528fedd.webm?t=1784547639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/d6aabf87408e5a15744b382bb528fedd.mp4?t=1784547639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed around managing limited magical power to defeat enemies, evade attacks, and traverse terrain. Monsters created through experiments within the lab block your path, demanding strategic use of magic tailored to each situation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;TREASURES&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/d0d241efe7b7d938036726acfb1406f9.poster.avif?t=1784547639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/d0d241efe7b7d938036726acfb1406f9.webm?t=1784547639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/d0d241efe7b7d938036726acfb1406f9.mp4?t=1784547639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Records related to the research facility and Fran are scattered throughout stages. Collecting them reveals the story's background, including Fran's origins and the facility's purpose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Costumes&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/61bf6a1575ea81f82ce63a11c2fc47f3.poster.avif?t=1784547639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/61bf6a1575ea81f82ce63a11c2fc47f3.webm?t=1784547639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/61bf6a1575ea81f82ce63a11c2fc47f3.mp4?t=1784547639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn new outfits by clearing special stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The records and magic of a girl who awoke deep within the laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather fragmented information as you aim to escape from the labyrinthine facility's innermost depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/396affc65ac338e2689009790af346d1.apng?t=1784547639\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/396affc65ac338e2689009790af346d1.poster.avif?t=1784547639\" class=\"bb_img\" width=68 height=78 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Outline&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Blue Artifact+” is a side-scrolling action game where Fran, a girl awakened deep within a research facility's underground, attempts to escape using magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility's interior serves as the stage, a complex, mutated dungeon. Scattered throughout the facility are the Doctor's records and information about Fran. Collecting these gradually reveals the facility's background and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with the magic tome left by the Doctor, Fran strives to escape from the depths of the labyrinthine facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Steam edition builds upon the free game version, implementing new stages, enemies, items, costumes, and other additional elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Magic&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185740/extras/d6aabf87408e5a15744b382bb528fedd.poster.avif?t=1784547639\" width=1170 height=658 ><